# mime.icons maps MIME-types to icons. this mapping is different for each
# iconset -- file-names may differ, as may completeness.  to change the
# mapping in a given icon-set, change the mime.icons file in that icon-set's
# folder.  the file you are currently reading is but a sample to model those
# files after; changing it will have no immediate effect and should be avoided.

